{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351280","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351280","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1035128001:0":{"text":"I used to live in one of the villages neighboring Holistone. A small but prosperous place.","source_cn":"我之前生活在圣石镇旁的村子里，虽然村里的人不多，但安居乐业。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEFDA93FCD611FA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035128002:1":{"text":"But those terrible roaming golems forced many of our fellow villagers to abandon their homes.","source_cn":"后面，有一些魔偶逐渐游荡过来，逼得大家不得不另寻家园。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE7F60B4754508D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035128003:1":{"text":"Finding new ones is no small task... all we could do was tidy our own house and offer it up.","source_cn":"但新的家园哪有那么好找，我们就把家里收拾了一番，让大家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DAB7013C998D99E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035128004:1":{"text":"That's what I mean by \"everyone.\"","source_cn":"他们就是村里的大家们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEEAC264A37CD58A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1035128004":{"text":"That's what I mean by \"everyone.\"","source_cn":"他们就是村里的大家们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEEAC264A37CD58A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1035128005:1":{"text":"With an entire village under our roof, things got a bit... tight. Thankfully, a relative here had some extra space.","source_cn":"这不是人越来越多嘛……都有点住不下了，反正我们家有亲戚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4D8634F895B3811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1035128006:1":{"text":"So we came to live here, and I still send supplies home when I can.","source_cn":"我就跟着父母来了圣石镇，偶尔给大家送点补给。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2C8B7F11D7BEE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"So why are you in Holistone?","source_cn":"那你怎么在圣石镇？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F40865CCECDC35B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So why are you in Holistone?","female":"So why are you in Holistone?","variant_male_record_index":"63068","variant_female_record_index":"63069","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:担心的玛丽娅":{"text":"Anxious Maria","source":"担心的玛丽娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":1}}